7a6dc", "message": "[Android] No longer cache the window size\n\nBecause onContextRectChanged happens after the surface creation thus, the window doesn't return the correct value when the surface gets created.", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:45Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "17430ef3726d1b3724c4f7f2ddb3dcc4ce27b190", "message": "[Android] Implemented mouse events", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:43Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ab49ece2f944e6dabf9ad974e5b08c40f5058a0", "message": "[Android] Implemented sf::TextEvent", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:40Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "634c3dc2a7a49c5b3b0cdb222d3f4e0ba08e5d62", "message": "[Android] Fixed memory leak when loading asset files", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:38Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "891cd261b885481a457fdb32e659b63dbf6e7379", "message": "Removed unnecessary sf:: prefix", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:36Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de791c05dc710d80a8d80767a55f2e108c3c5b5f", "message": "[Android] Added the joystick implementation", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:28Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fbd21962f099c68f9172a1f5b652ac135cf38df3", "message": "[Android] Improved input implementation", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:26Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4626e95491495e0fbdbfe9f41b80058bd6224618", "message": "[Android] Fixed WindowHandle and getSystemHandle()", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:23Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77567e965630b2ecc78e861d9389bda1aa2674f0", "message": "Implemented missing setVirtualKeyboardVisible method on desktop platforms", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:21Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "218c0897c88e3913dbd1d2344aa0b43258bb45b5", "message": "[Android] Added the Android version of extlibs headers", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:18Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6f98229a8e3794a33bf0f9ee7e1fd26696a1cf4", "message": "[Android] Removed dirty hack from Window.cpp", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:16Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "663dad18f254e1cc33fcfe653c4705d8dca3733c", "message": "[Android] Fixed compilation issue and enabled audio module for mips arches", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:14Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bc46dfb8f5275e9fa73e96f270801820f2e84945", "message": "[Android] Various adjustements", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:11Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f60ab6026386488454e6bf9ebcee59a59e2ad6cc", "message": "Added SFML_OS_ prefix to IOS and ANDROID variables", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:57:02Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c77b8a34962a2e379538f553d43e97fa5eadee0d", "message": "[Android] Moved getActivity(ActivitySttates*) to the system module\n\nSomehow this function gets stripped by compilators if I put this in the main module (which is what we want).\nTo solve this issue (and to avoid additional dependencies on sfml-window), I moved it to the system module since all SFML modules depend on it.", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:56:51Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4180e6b31fd5b599a0bb25380277b35848cc525a", "message": "[Android] Added tools (unix bash scripts) to recompile Android extlibs\n\nFor some reason, one might want to recompile the extlibs but this is a tedious task. That's why these scripts are provided.\nPlease read readme.txt before using them!", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:56:49Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90d8b3744209680f0edac1a4bf140c7f1e6e0b91", "message": "[Android] Removed ogg, FLAC, vorbis and vorbisenc dependencies", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:56:46Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cc0d982f72a584f17774c0b1e022491cf45fc610", "message": "[Android] Wrote a native activity acting as a bootstrap\n\nA current limitation prevents one library from depending on shared libraries.\nAs we have legal issues here (LGPL wants us to use shared libs of OpenAL-Soft and libsndfile), we're forced to use this homemade native activity which will manually load our shared libraries.", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:56:42Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "60894d1c1a5e51c6a02f85edbedf8ec91db1006b", "message": "[Android] Rewrote CMake scripts to compile SFML with our new toolchain", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:56:40Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9e80e1a3bf842032c750a986e96e86f046ed73c", "message": "[Android] Updated the Android CMake toolchain to support NDK r9\n\nIt brings support for 64-bits toolchains.", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:53:40Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b167c7a8d5c8bdb6a6938c55ccef3c7c2cf751a3", "message": "[Android] Replaced our homemade Android CMake toolchain with the one used for the OpenCV project\n\nhttp://code.google.com/p/android-cmake/", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:53:38Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "293b85af53cc0dd2d8f61e5fd338ee11b716f788", "message": "[Android] Recompiled extlibs/ properly\n\nExternal libraries are compiled with the latest NDK version (r9) with android-9 as API level using the recommended flags (see docs/).\nExternal libraries are now compiled without the so version suffix because the NDK strips it at install time.\nStatic libraries of libsndfile and OpenAL-Soft have been removed because of their non-permissive license. It now uses their shared libraries.\n\nNOTE: The audio module is disabled on MIPS arches because I was unable to compile OpenAL-Soft. Once the compilation issue fixed, I'll re-enable it.", "created_at": "2014-04-20T10:53:36Z", "repo": "esfml", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}